      "label": "About this template",
      "s": {
        "text": "For each dispatch of Generator A this makes a study case with its own operation scenario, runs a load flow, trips the contingency unit and runs an RMS simulation. A pass that does not converge or whose frequency does not settle skips to the next dispatch; the others add the nadir to the Headroom table and the frequency graph, and each study case is kept with its own operation scenario holding that dispatch. Fill in the project, Generator A, the contingency unit, the busbar on Run RMS simulation and the dispatch range."
      },
      "pin": [],
      "sv": 1
    },
